  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     jeweler bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Tool:</ansi>        carving knife
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> trophy antlers (x1), gold wire (x2), raw gem (x1)

